# Runtime dependencies for the container image, mirroring [project.dependencies]
# in pyproject.toml. The Dockerfile installs this lock with --require-hashes and
# then adds the locally built ca2a-runtime wheel with --no-deps, so nothing in
# the image is fetched unpinned. Keep it in step with pyproject.toml. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile requirements/runtime.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#     --python-version 3.11 -o requirements/runtime.txt
